      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRANSFORMATION (1) resumed in a Other at Murray Bridge Straight and finished fifth over 300m (17.01). Will strip fitter for the run. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. NOD FEENY (2) ran below best last time finishing fifth (20.06) over 342m at Angle Park from Box 2. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Key runner on best form. LOVE SHINE (8) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (31.60) in a Grade 6 at Angle Park. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. BLUE ENERGY (6) was well fancied in betting last start but could only manage 7 lengths away in third (20.24). The form out of his last race has been franked. Well placed and gets his chance.",
